background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Bottom floor of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Forgotten%20Tomb\">Forgotten Tomb</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Varying%20Monster%20Spawn\">Varying Monster Spawn</a> in which the common creatures are a <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33394,31702,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33394, 31702, 13)</a>. The respawn time of this spawn point is every 3 to 6 minutes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a> at the end of the tomb until Mahatheb spawns. The boss itself is not much stronger than the regular monsters in the tomb.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 14 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-elem